// Warm-up ramps for the chess lessons: run `node tools/ramps.js` to write them into lessons.json (step.ramp),
// then `node tools/check_lessons.js` to verify every position and answer with the engine.
// A ramp comes before a lesson's scored problems and is not scored:
//   {k:'explain', fen, ar:[[from,to,cls]], hl:[[sq,cls]], t, b}   read-only: board marks + short explanation (次へ)
//   {k:'try', fen, ok:[uci...], look:[sq...], g, h, y}            a guided / practice position (any move in ok is right)
// Hints in a 'try' item go concept (h) → where to look (look squares) → the answer.
// Texts are {ja,en,zh,ko,es,fr,pt,de,hi,ar}.
